('reading', 'true_false_not_given', 'Food Technology', 'hard', 7, 'Every country that has approved cultured meat for commercial sale has also banned the word "meat" from appearing on its label.', '23000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001', null, null, '"NOT GIVEN"', 'The passage mentions labelling restrictions separately, describing them as coming from "several countries, including some with powerful traditional livestock industries" — it never states these are the same countries that approved cultured meat for sale.', 'Two facts mentioned near each other are not necessarily linked — check whether the passage actually connects the two groups of countries before assuming a cause-and-effect or overlap.', '{"true_false_not_given"}', 70, 4, false),
('reading', 'matching_headings', 'Food Technology', 'medium', 6.5, 'Which paragraph explains the technical process used to produce cultured meat?', '23000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001', null, '["Paragraph 1: Introduction and history of cultured meat","Paragraph 2: How cultured meat is produced","Paragraph 3: Environmental claims and uncertainties","Paragraph 4: Ethical considerations","Paragraph 5: Regulatory approval around the world","Paragraph 6: Consumer acceptance and price"]', '"Paragraph 2: How cultured meat is produced"', 'Paragraph 2 describes the biopsy, bioreactors, growth medium, and scaffolding used to produce cultured meat.', 'Match the heading to the paragraph''s overall purpose rather than a single repeated word like "meat," which appears throughout the passage.', '{"matching_headings"}', 75, 5, false),
