('reading', 'multiple_choice', 'Food Technology', 'hard', 7, 'According to the passage, what is described as a major remaining technical hurdle to achieving price parity with conventional meat?', '23000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001', null, '["Finding enough animals willing to provide biopsy samples","Scaling bioreactor production from laboratory to industrial scale","Developing new government safety regulations","Persuading farmers to abandon conventional livestock farming"]', '"Scaling bioreactor production from laboratory to industrial scale"', 'The passage identifies "scaling bioreactor production from a laboratory scale of a few litres to an industrial scale of many thousands of litres" as the key remaining hurdle to price parity.', 'The final sentence of the passage names the hurdle explicitly using the word "namely" — locate this signpost word to find the precise answer.', '{"multiple_choice"}', 70, 9, false),
