('reading', 'sentence_completion', 'Culture & Economics', 'medium', 6.5, 'Complete the sentence using NO MORE THAN THREE WORDS: A single vinyl record can be sold directly to fans at a considerably higher ______ than a comparable digital sale.', '24000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004', null, null, '"price point"', 'The passage states a vinyl record "can be sold directly to fans, often at a considerably higher price point and profit margin than a comparable digital sale."', 'The question omits the second item in the passage''s pair ("price point and profit margin") — only the first is required to fit the word limit.', '{"sentence_completion"}', 55, 12, false),
