('reading', 'matching_information', 'Climate Science', 'medium', 6.5, 'Which paragraph introduces the concept of abrupt thaw, as distinct from gradual thawing?', '24000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005', null, '["Paragraph 1","Paragraph 2","Paragraph 3","Paragraph 4","Paragraph 5","Paragraph 6"]', '"Paragraph 4"', 'Paragraph 4 contrasts the older, gradual model of thaw with "a distinct and considerably less predictable category of change known as abrupt thaw."', 'The term "abrupt thaw" is introduced and defined in this paragraph specifically.', '{"matching_information"}', 60, 4, false),
