('reading', 'matching_headings', 'Society', 'hard', 6.5, 'Choose the correct heading for Paragraph 3 from the list below: i. The origins of the repair café movement / ii. A description of a typical repair café session / iii. Three main reasons people take part / iv. Products designed to be difficult to repair / v. Practical limitations volunteers encounter / vi. Doubts about the scale of the movement''s impact / vii. Signs of a more organised future / viii. The cost of professional repair services', '25000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002', null, '["The origins of the repair café movement","A description of a typical repair café session","Three main reasons people take part","Products designed to be difficult to repair","Practical limitations volunteers encounter","Doubts about the scale of the movement''s impact","Signs of a more organised future","The cost of professional repair services"]', '"Three main reasons people take part"', 'Paragraph 3 opens by stating "three themes recur consistently in surveys of participants" and goes on to describe environmental, economic, and social motivations.', 'Look for a paragraph that explicitly signals a numbered list of reasons ("three themes") — this is a strong clue to the matching heading.', '{"matching_headings"}', 75, 1, false),
