('reading', 'matching_headings', 'Environment', 'hard', 6.5, 'Choose the correct heading for Paragraph 2 from the list below: i. The legal history of wolf protection in Europe / ii. The ecological ripple effects of a returning predator / iii. Natural recolonisation rather than deliberate reintroduction / iv. Tension with livestock farmers and mitigation measures / v. Debate over relaxing legal protections / vi. Efforts to foster coexistence between humans and wolves / vii. Genetic risks facing a fragmented population / viii. The economic cost of wolf-related tourism', '26000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003', null, '["The legal history of wolf protection in Europe","The ecological ripple effects of a returning predator","Natural recolonisation rather than deliberate reintroduction","Tension with livestock farmers and mitigation measures","Debate over relaxing legal protections","Efforts to foster coexistence between humans and wolves","Genetic risks facing a fragmented population","The economic cost of wolf-related tourism"]', '"The ecological ripple effects of a returning predator"', 'Paragraph 2 describes how wolves affect deer behaviour, forest regeneration, and other species through a "trophic cascade," matching this heading.', 'Identify the paragraph’s central idea in your own words before scanning the heading list, rather than matching on single repeated words.', '{"matching_headings"}', 75, 1, false),
