('53000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000046', 'part1', 'groupb-creative-activity', 'Creativity', null, '["Do you consider yourself a creative person?","What creative activities do you enjoy doing?","Did you do many creative activities when you were a child?","Do you think everyone has the ability to be creative?"]'),
