('53000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000052', 'part1', 'groupb-future-plan', 'Future plans', null, '["Do you like to plan things in advance?","What are your plans for the near future?","Do you think it is important to have a plan for your life?","Who do you usually talk to about your future plans?"]'),
