('53000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000058', 'part1', 'groupb-helped-environment', 'The environment', null, '["Do you try to protect the environment in your daily life?","What environmental problems concern you the most?","Do you recycle regularly at home?","Do you think individuals can make a real difference to the environment?"]'),
